<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">ADD TO CLOSET</view><text class="title">添加衣服</text><text class="subtitle">先记录，再让衣橱慢慢懂你。</text><view class="photo-picker card" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{imagePath}}" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="photo-empty"><text class="plus">＋</text><text>拍照或从相册选择</text></view></view><view class="form card"><view class="field"><text>类别</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{categories}}" bindchange="chooseCategory"><text class="picker-value">{{category}}</text></picker></view><view class="field"><text>颜色</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{colors}}" bindchange="chooseColor"><text class="picker-value">{{color}}</text></picker></view><view class="field"><text>风格</text><input placeholder="例如：简约、通勤" value="{{style}}" bindinput="inputStyle"/></view><view class="field"><text>关键词</text><input placeholder="例如：白衬衫、基础款" value="{{keywords}}" bindinput="inputKeywords"/></view></view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}">{{loading ? '正在保存…' : '保存到衣橱'}}</button></view>
